  {
   "text": "A sabbath rest remains for us",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.53,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Whoever enters stops their works",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.45,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Like God rested from His own",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.1,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Make every effort to go on",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.49,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So none fall by disobedience",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.54,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Let us hold fast to the promise",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.67,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The word of God is living and active",
